[
  {
    "type": "minecraft:set_name",
    "name": {
      "text": "War Hog's Blighted Harvest",
      "color": "green",
      "italic": false
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "minecraft:set_lore",
    "lore": [
      "",
      [
        {
          "text": "Souls Collected: ",
          "color": "dark_green",
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "text": "0",
          "color": "green"
        },
        {
          "text": " / 10",
          "color": "dark_green"
        }
      ],
      "",
      "When the Nether was opened to the Overworld,",
      "piglins flooded forth to reap the bountiful",
      "resources. This scythe is their blighted harvest.",
      [
        "Rarity: ",
        {
          "text": "Mythic",
          "color": "green",
          "italic": true
        }
      ],
      "",
      [
        {
          "text": "Reaper's Curse: ",
          "color": "green",
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "text": "Each entity killed fills this item",
          "color": "gray",
          "italic": false
        }
      ],
      {
        "text": "with a single soul. Upon reaching 10 souls, a blast",
        "color": "gray",
        "italic": false
      },
      {
        "text": "of Wither III is released in a 10 block radius.",
        "color": "gray",
        "italic": false
      },
      [
        {
          "text": "Dark Harvest: ",
          "color": "green",
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "text": "Using this scythe to till farmland or",
          "color": "gray",
          "italic": false
        }
      ],
      {
        "text": "to harvest crops (such as wheat, carrots, beets,",
        "color": "gray",
        "italic": false
      },
      {
        "text": "and potatoes) will also till or harvest nearby",
        "color": "gray",
        "italic": false
      },
      {
        "text": "blocks or full-grown crops.",
        "color": "gray",
        "italic": false
      }
    ],
    "mode": "append"
